# Build context for docker/Dockerfile.* — only what the binaries need.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!docker/
crates/**/target/
**/.DS_Store
# A `*` exclusion also excludes the `qa` DIRECTORY itself, so re-including a
# path inside it requires walking the parent back in first — otherwise docker
# never descends into qa/ and `COPY qa/harness/...` fails with "not found".
!qa
qa/*
!qa/harness
# docker/Dockerfile.web builds from the repository root like every other image here, so the web
# sources are admitted; what a local install or build leaves behind is not.
!web
web/node_modules/
web/.next/
web/coverage/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
**/.env*
